		(at 135.128 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(thickness 0.3556)
				(bold yes)
				(italic yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "fea952c5-e809-423c-8c48-6a1e1c469211")
	)
	(text_box "• Lines that can be disabled (Hi-Z) via OE_MCU (active high, with built-in 10k pull-downs).\n• 10k pull-up on RX_MCU to ensure the idle level (3.3V) when the buffer is disabled.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 187.96 0)
		(size 95.25 8.0376)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "15d72f3e-8ef2-441d-903b-60f0b611cf05")
	)
	(text_box "• Monostable hold time: τ ≈ 10 ms (1MΩ / 10nF + fast discharge diode)\n• High-impedance tap: Does not load UART RX/TX lines"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 107.95 0)
		(size 95.25 5.9929)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "33c4473c-0115-444a-908f-f473a691ad4c")
	)
	(text_box "• Bus specs: Half-duplex up to 500 kbps (Slew-rate limited, 120Ω terminated)\n• Common-mode protection: -7V to +12V (SM712 TVS + 10Ω series)\n• Control: DE/RE tied together (Default RX mode via 10kΩ pull-down)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 113.03 69.85 0)
		(size 96.52 8.0376)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5bd1b276-8cf4-4f3b-9693-22438cf70922")
	)
	(text_box "• Input range: 3V3 to 5V differential (R_series = 660Ω, ~2.73mA @ 3V3)\n• Max frequency: 5 Mbps (Push-pull output, active-high)\n• Protection: Reverse/Overvoltage clamp at 6.0V (SMAJ6.0A)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.58 135.89 0)
		(size 80.01 8.0376)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9d841abc-699a-42d6-a348-437511995db7")
	)
	(text_box "• Input range: 3V3 to 5V differential (R_series = 660Ω, ~2.73mA @ 3V3)\n• Max frequency: 5 Mbps (Push-pull output, active-high)\n• Protection: Reverse/Overvoltage clamp at 6.0V (SMAJ6.0A)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 113.03 135.89 0)
		(size 80.01 8.0376)
